<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Group Five appoints Mike Lomas CEO.</title>
<headline>Group Five appoints Mike Lomas CEO.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm Group Five Ltd announced on Thursday it had appointed Mike Lomas as chief executive officer with immediate effect.  </p>
<p>Lomas, most recently managing director of Group Five's engineering division, replaces Theunis Kotzee who resigned May 13 following policy differences with the board.</p>
<p>&quot;I have a strong belief in the potential of the group and know that I will be able to build successfully on the foundation of my predecessor,&quot; Lomas said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
